\par\par \b \uc2 DeFi Development Corp.\uc2  Provides Update on \uc2 DeFi Development Corporation UK PLC\b0\par\par\uc2 363 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 June 2026\par 14:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2026, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 BOCA RATON, FL, June 29, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \uc2 DeFi Development Corp.\uc2  (Nasdaq: DFDV) (the "Company"), the first US public company with a treasury strategy built to accumulate and compound Solana ("SOL"), today announced that \uc2 DeFi Development Corporation UK PLC\uc2  ("DFDV UK") is no longer affiliated with the Company's treasury accelerator strategy.\par \par \uc2 DFDV has no ongoing exposure to DFDV UK and will not have any role in its future operations or strategic direction. The UK company has separately announced its intention to change its name to \uc2 Cykel AI PLC\uc2  and pursue a strategic focus on \b \highlight22\uc2 artificial intelligence\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In connection with this separation, DFDV's revolving credit facility with the UK company has been terminated.\par \par \uc2 For more information, visit defidevcorp.com {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=y9sqO_s3IaevdAGv_oXpWgmfgG7lC30LtvJveaaagwoFw0jcm7HQMkTcnSldzbsJSRycxbzqJzKUctxi59tu3g"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=y9sqO_s3IaevdAGv_oXpWgmfgG7lC30LtvJveaaagwoFw0jcm7HQMkTcnSldzbsJSRycxbzqJzKUctxi59tu3g}}}\uc2 == . To stay up to date with the latest developments and insights, subscribe to our blog {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=IQ7KTKZaQRWQiqtzXGKGYYo2WOb5Lm7yz0n6FRsEqTEyNiLyphpl4ANTBWTMyH0NNW1XbNTQD_crvHF-ZKLauw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=IQ7KTKZaQRWQiqtzXGKGYYo2WOb5Lm7yz0n6FRsEqTEyNiLyphpl4ANTBWTMyH0NNW1XbNTQD_crvHF-ZKLauw}}}\uc2 == .\par \par \uc2 About \uc2 DeFi Development Corp.\par \par \uc2 DeFi Development Corp.\uc2  (Nasdaq: DFDV) has adopted a treasury policy under which the principal holding in its treasury reserve is allocated to SOL. Through this strategy, the Company provides investors with direct economic exposure to SOL, while also actively participating in the growth of the Solana ecosystem. In addition to holding and staking SOL, \uc2 DeFi Development Corp.\uc2  operates its own validator infrastructure, generating staking rewards and fees from delegated stake. The Company is also engaged across decentralized finance (DeFi) opportunities and continues to explore innovative ways to support and benefit from \uc2 Solana\uc2 's expanding application layer.\par \par \uc2 The Company is also an AI-powered online platform that connects the commercial real estate industry by providing value-add services and software subscriptions to multifamily and commercial property professionals, as the Company connects the increasingly complex ecosystem that stakeholders have to manage. The Company's data and software offerings are generally offered on a subscription basis as software as a service.\par \par \uc2 Investor Contact:\par \par \uc2 ir@defidevcorp.com {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=762yvUSXWsRuHPtDmQYRP0hoqQkA-2iUqpQj5BS8TkrTf-w0r1mbd8PqJZ1m1Eilnd3SAfix3nAFCKqd1VSjjquSbDGLkRvAvvhbNdbgJc4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=762yvUSXWsRuHPtDmQYRP0hoqQkA-2iUqpQj5BS8TkrTf-w0r1mbd8PqJZ1m1Eilnd3SAfix3nAFCKqd1VSjjquSbDGLkRvAvvhbNdbgJc4}}}\uc2 =\par \par \uc2 Media Contact:\par \par \uc2 press@defidevcorp.com {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=2rJFH5IgL6ba-nfjCKbpyFLBgza5GQ9Y01VpgFXh16aEH_c4kJmAZzQK-3plWq_IEIRZ0ayaI1Oces5itdEmXRTvdFHvMVHKg4mZyDADCU0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=2rJFH5IgL6ba-nfjCKbpyFLBgza5GQ9Y01VpgFXh16aEH_c4kJmAZzQK-3plWq_IEIRZ0ayaI1Oces5itdEmXRTvdFHvMVHKg4mZyDADCU0}}}\uc2 =\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \p