\par\par \b \uc2 Press Release: \uc2 CGI\uc2  and \uc2 NetApp\uc2  deepen global alliance to drive innovation, accelerate growth and strengthen client outcomes\b0\par\par\uc2 997 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 June 2026\par 12:30\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2026, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 Stock Market Symbols\par \par \uc2 GIB.A (TSX)\par \par \uc2 GIB (NYSE)\par \par \uc2 cgi.com/newsroom\par \par \uc2 Partnership delivers a combination of intelligent data infrastructure with deep cloud and AI expertise to modernize operations and improve performance across hybrid environments\par \par \uc2 MONTR\u201\'00\'C9AL and SAN JOSE, Calif., June 22, 2026 /CNW/ - \uc2 CGI\uc2  (TSX: GIB.A) (\uc2 NYSE: GIB\uc2 ) and \uc2 NetApp\uc2  (NASDAQ: NTAP), the Intelligent Data Infrastructure company, today announced that NetApp Keystone will power \uc2 CGI\uc2 's block storage solutions within its shared services platform. This expansion of the companies' global alliance partnership, further strengthens their relationship and reaffirms a shared commitment to delivering measurable outcomes for clients worldwide.\par \par \uc2 Together, \uc2 CGI\uc2  and \uc2 NetApp\uc2  will help organizations modernize IT infrastructure, improve data management, and advance \b \highlight22\uc2 artificial intelligence\b0 \highlight\uc2  (AI) initiatives across private, public, and hybrid cloud environments. By combining the power of the \uc2 NetApp\uc2  platform to help customers build intelligent data infrastructure supported by scalable storage capabilities with \uc2 CGI\uc2 's deep expertise in digital transformation, cloud, AI, and managed services, clients can strengthen operational efficiency, enhance cybersecurity, and accelerate innovation -- enabling them to more effectively translate technology investment into business outcomes.\par \par \uc2 With NetApp Keystone, a flexible and simple subscription-based service that adapts to changing business needs, customers can accelerate critical block workloads with industry-leading performance, intelligent data management, and high availability across data centers and cloud environments, all delivered on storage with built-in security that provides real-time threat detection, protection and recovery.\par \par \uc2 "The expansion of our partnership with \uc2 NetApp\uc2  reflects a strong commitment on both sides to drive meaningful outcomes for our clients," said Virginia Williams, Senior Vice-President and Business Unit Leader, U.S. Northwest Operations at \uc2 CGI\uc2 . "The technology, expertise and innovation offered by this powerful alliance will continue to help clients modernize their IT environments, become more data-driven and prepare for AI at scale."\par \par \uc2 This next phase of the alliance reflects a shared commitment to broadening and deepening the relationship, with \uc2 CGI\uc2  and \uc2 NetApp\uc2  working closely together to design, deliver, and operate best-of-breed solutions that support clients' evolving digital needs. \uc2 CGI\uc2  will deliver services on behalf of \uc2 NetApp\uc2 , while \uc2 NetApp\uc2  will partner with \uc2 CGI\uc2  to deliver enterprise-grade data and storage services that enable flexible, consumption-based solutions for joint clients across industries.\par \par \uc2 "By expanding our partnership with \uc2 CGI\uc2 , we're enabling our shared customers to build a resilient, secure solution that delivers consistent performance and intelligent data management for their most critical workloads," said Alvaro Celis, Chief Partner and Ecosystem Officer at \uc2 NetApp\uc2 . "Working side-by-side, \uc2 CGI\uc2  and \uc2 NetApp\uc2  will continue to empower organizations to achieve better business outcomes through an intelligent data infrastructure that simplifies hybrid cloud adoption and securely unlocks greater value from their data."\par \par \uc2 About \uc2 CGI\par \par \uc2 Founded in 1976, \uc2 CGI\uc2  is among the largest independent technology and professional services firms in the world. With 94,000 consultants and professionals across the globe, \uc2 CGI\uc2  delivers an end-to-end portfolio of capabilities, from strategic IT and business consulting to systems integration, managed IT and business process services and intellectual property solutions. \uc2 CGI\uc2  works with clients through a local relationship model complemented by a global delivery network that helps clients digitally transform their organizations and accelerate results. \uc2 CGI\uc2  Fiscal 2026 reported revenue is CA$15.91 billion and \uc2 CGI\uc2  shares are listed on the TSX (GIB.A) and the NYSE (GIB). Learn more at cgi.com.\par \par \uc2 About \uc2 CGI\uc2 's alliances\par \par \uc2 CGI\uc2 's global alliance strategy features partnerships with more than 150 technology companies and supports its local relationship model complemented by a global delivery network. This approach enables \uc2 CGI\uc2  consultants and professionals to remain independent and agile in selecting solutions that best fit each client's unique needs, including technology stack requirements and considerations such as digital and AI sovereignty. Learn more at cgi.com/alliances\par \par \uc2 About \uc2 NetApp\par \par \uc2 For more than three decades, \uc2 NetApp\uc2  has helped the world's leading organizations navigate change -- from the rise of enterprise storage to the intelligent era defined by data and AI. Today, \uc2 NetApp\uc2  is the Intelligent Data Infrastructure company, helping customers turn data into a catalyst for innovation, resilience, and growth.\par \par \uc2 At the heart of that infrastructure is the \uc2 NetApp\uc2  data platform -- the unified, enterprise-grade, intelligent foundation that connects, protects, and activates data across every cloud, workload, and environment. Built on the proven power of NetApp ONTAP, our leading data management software and OS, and enhanced by automation through the AI Data Engine and AFX, it delivers observability, resilience, and intelligence at scale.\par \par \uc2 Disaggregated by design, the NetApp data platform separates storage, services, and control so enterprises can modernize faster, scale efficiently, and innovate without lock-in. As the only enterprise storage platform natively embedded in the world's largest clouds, it gives organizations the freedom to run any workload anywhere with consistent performance, governance, and protection.\par \par \uc2 With NetApp, data is always ready -- ready to defend against threats, ready to power AI, and ready to drive the next breakthrough. That's why the world's most forward-thinking enterprises trust NetApp to turn intelligence into advantage. Learn more at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.netapp.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.netapp.com}}}\uc2  or follow us on X, LinkedIn, Facebook, and Instagram.\par \par \uc2 NETAPP, the NETAPP logo, and the marks listed at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.netapp.com/TM"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.netapp.com/TM}}}\uc2  are trademarks of NetApp, Inc. Other company and product names may be trademarks of their respective owners.\par \par \uc2 View original content:{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/cgi-and-netapp-deepen-global-alliance-to-drive-innovation-accelerate-growth-and-strengthen-client-outcomes-302805521.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/cgi-and-netapp-deepen-global-alliance-to-drive-innovation-accelerate-growth-and-strengthen-client-outcomes-302805521.html}}}\par \par \uc2 SOURCE CGI Inc.\par \par \uc2 /CONTACT: \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Copyright CNW Group 2026 \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 22 Jun 2026 06:32 ET *CGI And NetApp: NetApp Keystone Will Power CGI's Block Storage Solutions Within Its Shared Services Platform >GIB\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 22 Jun 2026 06:32 ET *CGI, NetApp: Will Help Organizations Modernize IT Infrastructure, Improve Data Management and Advance AI Initiatives Across Private, Public and Hybrid Cloud Environments. >GIB\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (MORE TO FOLLOW) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 June 22, 2026 06:32 ET (10:32 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Document DJDN000020260622em6m000zf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
