\par\par \b \uc2 EQS\uc2 -News: \uc2 Sirma\uc2  Becomes Temenos Referral Partner\b0\par\par\uc2 543 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 June 2026\par 09:06\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires German\par \uc2 RTDJGE\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2026, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par EQS-News: \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sirma Group Holding\f28 \uc2 \f2  / Key word(s): Alliance \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sirma\f28 \uc2 \f2  Becomes Temenos Referral Partner \par 2026-06-22 / 09:06 CET/CEST \par The issuer is solely responsible for the content of this announcement. \par  \par =---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sirma\f28 \uc2 \f2  Becomes Temenos Referral Partner \par  \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sirma\f28 \uc2 \f2 , a leading technology company with strong expertise in financial services and digital transformation,\u160\'00\'A0 announced \par that it has become a Temenos Referral Partner. \par  \par Under this relationship, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sirma\f28 \uc2 \f2  will identify and introduce qualified opportunities for \f28 \uc2 \f2 Temenos\f28 \uc2 \f2  solutions in selected \par markets and client segments, initially in Bulgaria and Albania. The arrangement supports new business development \par through \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sirma\f28 \uc2 \f2 's market knowledge, client relationships, and regional expertise. \par  \par Tsvetomir Doskov, SVP BFSI at \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sirma\f28 \uc2 \f2 , commented: \par "Becoming a \f28 \uc2 \f2 Temenos\f28 \uc2 \f2  Referral Partner reflects \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sirma\f28 \uc2 \f2 's focus on helping clients accelerate their transformation with \par solutions that are robust, scalable, and ready for real-world adoption. We look forward to supporting financial \par institutions with access to \f28 \uc2 \f2 Temenos\f28 \uc2 \f2 ' proven banking technology, alongside \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sirma\f28 \uc2 \f2 's specialized, AI-native digital \par solutions." \par  \par Edgardo Torres-Caballero, SVP Global Partnerships at \f28 \uc2 \f2 Temenos\f28 \uc2 \f2 , added: \par "Partners play an important role in expanding the reach of \f28 \uc2 \f2 Temenos\f28 \uc2 \f2  into defined markets, bringing strong local networks \par and expertise to support banks on their modernization journeys. We are pleased to welcome \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sirma\f28 \uc2 \f2  to our Referral Partner \par program, strengthening our engagement with financial institutions in the CEE region." \par  \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sirma\f28 \uc2 \f2  and \f28 \uc2 \f2 Temenos\f28 \uc2 \f2  have worked together for a number of years. \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sirma\f28 \uc2 \f2 's CAR service is available on the Temenos Exchange \par ecosystem of partner solutions for \f28 \uc2 \f2 Temenos\f28 \uc2 \f2  clients considering a migration to the cloud or SaaS. \par  \par ### \par  \par About \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sirma\f28 \uc2 \f2  \par  \par Founded in 1992, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sirma Group Holding JSC\f28 \uc2 \f2  (\f28 \uc2 \f2 Sirma\f28 \uc2 \f2 ) is a European technology group delivering enterprise software \par solutions, with a strong and growing emphasis on arti\u64257\'FB\'01cial intelligence as a key enabler of business transformation, \par and extensive expertise across banking, insurance, healthcare, travel and hospitality, transportation, logistics, \par retail, and the public sector. The company combines deep industry knowledge with proprietary platforms, complex \par enterprise systems, and advanced \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 artificial intelligence\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , delivered through its\u160\'00\'A0\f28 \uc2 \f2 Sirma\f28 \uc2 \f2 .AI\u160\'00\'A0Enterprise platform, to \par support organizations in their digital, data, and process transformations. These solutions transform complex data into \par actionable insights, driving growth, resilience, and operational efficiency for hundreds of clients worldwide. \par Headquartered in Sofia, the company is dual-listed on the Frankfurt and Bulgarian Stock Exchanges [SIRM]. \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sirma\f28 \uc2 \f2  \par operates globally through offices in the USA, UK, Germany, Albania, Romania, Brazil, and the UAE.\u160\'00\'A0\u160\'00\'A0 \par  \par Media contact: \par  \par Svetlana Kanazireva - svetlana.kanazireva@sirma.com \par  \par PR Director \par  \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sirma Group Holding JSC\f28 \uc2 \f2  \par  \par =---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- \par 2026-06-22 CET/CEST Dissemination of a Corporate News, transmitted by EQS News - a service of \f28 \uc2 \f2 EQS Group\f28 \uc2 \f2 . \par The issuer is solely responsible for the content of this announcement. \par The EQS Distribution Services include Regulatory Announcements, Financial/Corporate News and Press Releases. \par View original content: EQS News \par  \par =---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- \par Language:     English \par Company:      \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sirma Group Holding\f28 \uc2 \f2  \par               135 Tsarigradsko Shosse Blvd. \par               1784 Sofia \par               Bulgaria \par Phone:        +35929768310 \par E-mail:       ir@sirma.com \par Internet:     \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://investors.sirma.com/en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://investors.sirma.com/en}}}\uc2 \f2  \par ISIN:         BG1100032140 \par WKN:          A142WT \par Listed:       Regulated Market in Frankfurt (Prime Standard) \par EQS News ID:  2350398 \par \u160\'00\'A0 \par End of News   EQS News Service \par =------------ \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 2350398\u160\'00\'A0\u160\'00\'A02026-06-22\u160\'00\'A0CET/CEST\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Image link: \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://nwr.eqs-cockpit.com/fncls2.ssx?application_id=2350398&application_name=news&site_id=dow_jones%7e%7e%7ebed8b539-0373-42bd-8d0e-f3efeec9bbed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://nwr.eqs-cockpit.com/fncls2.ssx?applicat