\par\par \b \uc2 Giotto.ai and \uc2 KPS AG\uc2  join forces to bring Giotto.ai\u8217\'20\'19s breakthrough, sovereign and portable technology to European enterprise clients\b0\par\par\uc2 754 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 June 2026\par 10:30\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires German\par \uc2 RTDJGE\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2026, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 \f2 Dynamics Group AG\f28 \uc2 \f2  / Key word(s): Miscellaneous \par Giotto.ai and \f28 \uc2 \f2 KPS AG\f28 \uc2 \f2  join forces to bring Giotto.ai's breakthrough, sovereign and portable technology to European \par enterprise clients \par 2026-06-22 / 10:30 CET/CEST \par  \par =---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- \par PRESS RELEASE \par Giotto.ai and \f28 \uc2 \f2 KPS AG\f28 \uc2 \f2  join forces to bring Giotto.ai's breakthrough, sovereign and portable technology to European \par enterprise clients \par The strategic partnership brings access to Giotto's AI technology, product innovation and enterprise-grade \par implementation capabilities to European clients. \par  \par Munich/Lausanne, 22 June 2026. Giotto.ai, the pioneering Swiss AI Lab, and \f28 \uc2 \f2 KPS AG\f28 \uc2 \f2 , the leading consulting partner for \par digital transformation, today announced their partnership to bring Giotto.ai's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Artificial Intelligence\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  technology to \par European clients (companies, institutions, governments, etc.), combining advanced AI reasoning with enterprise-grade \par implementation capabilities. \par  \par This joint strategic move is part of a global mission with a strong European foundation. The Giotto.ai/KPS partnership \par represents a concrete step to build sovereign, high-performance, controllable AI for enterprises and institutions, with \par data autonomy and strategic independence at the core. It follows the recent announcement of Giotto.ai's collaboration \par with SAP, a global leader in enterprise applications and business AI, to explore the integration of advanced AI \par reasoning capabilities into SAP Joule Agents. \par  \par Giotto.ai brings an AI model and OS designed to run on the customer's preferred infrastructure, including private GPUs \par or sovereign cloud environments. Giotto's advanced reasoning can run where customers choose, from their own GPUs to \par Giotto-managed capacity and pre-installed Giotto appliances, with configurations starting from a single GPU. \par  \par Organizations can license Giotto on their own GPUs, access managed GPU capacity, or deploy it as pre-installed \par infrastructure. Last week, Giotto.ai has announced it was opening immediate access to selected institutional partners \par and public authorities to its sovereign AI model and operating system, ahead of a broader expansion to individual users \par in July. \par  \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 KPS\f28 \uc2 \f2  brings deep expertise in digital transformation, operational rollout, and large-scale adoption. Specifically, \f28 \uc2 \f2 KPS\f28 \uc2 \f2  \par brings more than 25 years of experience in digital transformation and extensive expertise in the implementation and \par integration of SAP landscapes to the partnership. As an SAP Gold Partner, \f28 \uc2 \f2 KPS\f28 \uc2 \f2  supports companies in optimising \par financial and business processes end-to-end and seamlessly integrating modern solutions into existing SAP system \par architectures - including SAP S/4HANA. \par  \par Aldo Podest\u224\'00\'E0, CEO at Giotto.ai, said: "Control, security, and governance as key differentiators:\u160\'00\'A0the joint proposition \par enables advanced AI adoption without compromising data governance, security, auditability, or operational control. Our \par partnership also brings strong commercial relevance:\u160\'00\'A0\f28 \uc2 \f2 KPS\f28 \uc2 \f2  has a clear focus on retail, consumer goods and fashion across \par Europe, which makes the partnership with Giotto's portable, sovereign AI technology immediately relevant for concrete \par enterprise use cases and scalable market entry." \par  \par Leonardo Musso, CEO at \f28 \uc2 \f2 KPS\f28 \uc2 \f2 , said: "The intelligent orchestration of proven technologies like SAP with innovative AI \par tools like Giotto.ai enables us to build future-proof, customised solutions for our customers. Giotto's model \par performance and unique approach have completely convinced us. Our main goal is to generate real business value for our \par customers, and with this strong partnership, we're well positioned for future innovations." \par About Giotto.ai \par  \par Giotto.ai is a Swiss AI lab building sovereign AI models and operating systems for enterprises, institutions, \par governments and individual users. Giotto is designed to run across hosted infrastructure, private infrastructure and \par dedicated hardware, giving users greater control over how and where intelligence is deployed. Giotto's mission is to \par build advanced AI that is powerful, portable, transparent and controlled by its users. \par Media contacts: Thierry Meyer, Senior Partner, Dynamics Group - tme@dynamicsgroup.ch - +41 79 785 35 81 \par  \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 KPS AG\f28 \uc2 \f2  - Media contacts\u160\'00\'A0: \par  \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 KPS AG\f28 \uc2 \f2                        Schwartz Public Relations \par Katri \u160\'00\'A0Ojala-Alkawari        Marita B\u228\'00\'E4umer \par Beta-Stra\u223\'00\'DFe 10 H             Sendlinger Stra\u223\'00\'DFe 42a \par D-85774 Unterf\u246\'00\'F6hring         D-80331 M\u252\'00\'FCnchen \par Tel.: +49 (0) 89 35631-3331  Tel: +49 (0) 89 211871-62 \par Fax: +49 (0) 89 35631-3300   Fax: +49 (0) 89 211871-50 \par E-Mail: presse@kps.com       E-Mail: kps@schwartzpr.de \par \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.kps.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.kps.com}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.schwartzpr.de"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.schwartzpr.de}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Additional features:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 File: Press release (PDF)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 End of Media Release View original content: EQS News\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 2349514\u160\'00\'A0\u160\'00\'A02026-06-22\u160\'00\'A0CET/CEST\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Image link: \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://nwr.eqs-cockpit.com/fncls2.ssx?application_id=2349514&application_name=news&site_id=dow_jones%7e%7e%7ebed8b539-0373-42bd-8d0e-f3efeec9bbed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://nwr.eqs-cockpit.com/fncls2.ssx?application_id=2349514&application_name=news&site_id=dow_jones%7e%7e%7ebed8b539-0373-42bd-8d0e-f3efeec9bbed}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 22-06-26 0830GMT\f28 \par \par \uc2 Document RTDJGE0020260622em6m000cb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
